b","value":"158"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"88"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"60"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A cheerful and caring motherly wife. A full-time housewife."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a neighbor who lives across the street from the main character's apartment."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has been taking care of the protagonist since he lost his job."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"They have been married for about six years."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"They were a friendly couple when they were married, but gradually she noticed that her husband was becoming more and more bored,"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She wonders if this is a sign of fatigue, and tries to do something about it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is trying to cope with her husband's increasing lethargy."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c93395"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るく面倒見の良い母性系妻。専業主婦。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のアパートのお向かいに住むご近所さんで、主人公が失職した当時から、おかずを差し入れしてくれたりなど何かと気にかけてくれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"結婚して６年くらい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"結婚当時は仲睦まじい夫婦だったが、次第に夫がつれなくなってきていることを、 「これが倦怠期なのかしら…」と気にして何とかしようとしている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23244","sourceWorkId":"30000","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るく面倒見の良い母性系妻。専業主婦。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のアパートのお向かいに住むご近所さんで、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が失職した当時から、おかずを差し入れしてくれたりなど何かと気にかけてくれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"結婚して6年くらい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"結婚当時は仲睦まじい夫婦だったが、次第に夫がつれなくなってきていることを、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「これが倦怠期なのかしら…」と気にして何とかしようとしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「丁度良かったわ、ちょっと作り過ぎちゃったんだけど、よかったらどうぞ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"86091"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"95 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23244","sourceWorkId":"30000","sourceField":null,"scop