acter works."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a serious and clear personality. She is a firm and independent woman."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the wife of Takahiro Yoshimi and has been married for about four years."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She and her husband were married through an arranged marriage recommended by their business associates, and they married each other to save face with the matchmaker,"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, their personalities do not get along, and although they act normally on the outside, their marriage is not on the best of terms (not acrimonious)."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"After a failed first night with her husband, she has been sexless and has had almost no sexual experience."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c93396"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の働く事務所の社員。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"真面目でツンと澄ました性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しっかり者で自立した女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"結婚して４年くらい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夫とは仕事関係から勧められたお見合い結婚で、 互いに仲人の顔を立てて結婚したが、性格的にそりが合わず、 表では普通に振る舞うものの夫婦仲は微妙（険悪ではない）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夫との初夜で失敗してしまって以降はレスで、性経験はほぼ無いに等しい。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23245","sourceWorkId":"30000","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の働く事務所の社員。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"真面目でツンと澄ました性格。しっかり者で自立した女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"吉見貴裕の妻で、結婚して4年くらい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夫とは仕事関係から勧められたお見合い結婚で、互いに仲人の顔を立てて結婚したが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格的にそりが合わず、表では普通に振る舞うものの夫婦仲は微妙（険悪ではない）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夫との初夜で失敗してしまって以降はレスで、性経験はほぼ無いに等しい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ありがとう。あの人がいつもごめんなさいね」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"86092"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"92 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23245","sourceWorkId":"30000","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"160 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23245","sourceWorkId":"30000","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"