ivate life as well."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c93397"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c93398","characterName":"吉見 貴裕","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c93398"},"originalCharacterName":"吉見 貴裕","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"173"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kaho's husband. He runs a small construction company that he inherited from his parents."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He was the protagonist's senior at university and picked her up as a part-timer when she was in trouble after being laid off."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has come to impose on the protagonist not only at work but also in his personal life, saying that he helped him out of a tight spot."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has a voracious appetite for sex and, taking advantage of the fact that his wife doesn't say anything, goes to brothels and has young mistresses."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is a dynamic, caring, and big brotherly figure, but he is also a bit of an overzealous sportsman in terms of hierarchical relationships and male chauvinism."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c93398"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1c/1cb16b0cdee0fadec5060a49d4941e1162bb4a590a6151e0b5e4027b14c7ad08.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8a/8a19dfac37764c267da6340f8ce9bc9d57e8fd23712e75c2fd105d71aeccfb19.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c93399","characterName":"塚本 篤史","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c93399"},"originalCharacterName":"塚本 篤史","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"177"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Akari's sarcastic husband. He is a company employee. He is an intellectual and a bit nervous."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He and his wife have known each other since childhood."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"They were close when they were newlyweds, but he gradually came to see his older wife as a nagging mother, furthermore, he has started to develop feelings for a younger girl, a junior colleague, and is now not so friendly with Akari."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is somewhat condescending to the protagonist, who works part-time, and does not try to hide his contempt in his gaze."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is a typical jerk."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c93399"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e6/e6ec45884277e7bb0b2664858aa12a03d7bf4e48b2e25cfce17de62fea6f5840.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7e/7ecb606e56efd5f95fdae6c84d5225e1efce6957eb3b64b29f5fc93232f9c4b5.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p212","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:516","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p212","name":"Anim","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:30000:516","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p212","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p212","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p212","name":"アニム","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:126148:v29186","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p15756","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p15756","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p15756","name":"SVN","roleCodes":["publ